  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Search action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "search-button",
      "description": "Circular submit action; disabled for invalid/composing queries and while slash discovery is open.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-search-button\" aria-label=\"Search Google\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-search-button{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#1a73e8;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,transform .15s}.ds-search-button:hover{background:#1559bc}.ds-search-button:active{transform:scale(.94)}.ds-search-button:disabled{background:#f1f3f4;color:#81868d;cursor:default}.ds-search-button:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-choice:focus-visible,.ds-nav button:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-example:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8ab4f8;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tool input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "White editable field inside a tinted tool.",
      "html": "<label style=\"font:11px Geist,Arial,sans-serif;color:#59616c\">Website domain<input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"example.com\" aria-label=\"Website domain\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-input{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;margin-top:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#1967d2) 20%,white);color:var(--ink,#202124);border-radius:8px;padding:11px;font-size:13px;min-height:44px;box-sizing:border-box}.ds-search-button:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-choice:focus-visible,.ds-nav button:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-example:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8ab4f8;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tool choices",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Pressed choices use the current tool accent.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-choices\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Stock information\"><button class=\"ds-choice\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Price</button><button class=\"ds-choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">News</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-choices{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;padding:8px;background:var(--tint,#f5f8ff)}.ds-choice{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;min-height:44px;min-width:44px;font-size:11px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#1967d2) 15%,white);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;background:#ffffff70;color:var(--ink,#202124);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s}.ds-choice[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--accent,#1967d2);color:white;border-color:var(--accent,#1967d2)}.ds-choice:hover:not([aria-pressed=true]){background:white}.ds-search-button:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-choice:focus-visible,.ds-nav button:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-example:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8ab4f8;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search filter chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Removable syntax token with a full touch target.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-label=\"Remove Website: example.com\"><span>Website: example.com</span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 6-12 12M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-height:44px;min-width:44px;background:#fff9;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#1967d2) 18%,white);border-radius:7px;color:var(--accent,#1967d2);font-size:11px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-chip span{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-chip:hover{background:white}.ds-search-button:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-choice:focus-visible,.ds-nav button:focus-visible,.ds-chip:focus-visible,.ds-example:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8ab4f8;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Slash discovery control",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "slash-button",
      "description": "Opens the searchable tool menu without discarding the current query.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-slash\" aria-label=\"Browse all search tools\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-slash{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;border:0;background:none;border-radius:10px;color:#697078;cursor:pointer}.ds-slash span{border:1px solid #d9dde3;border-radius:5px;width:23px;height:25px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:15px;background:#fafbfc}.ds-slash:hover,.ds-slash[aria-expanded=true]{background:#f1f5fb;color:#1967d2}.ds-slash:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8ab4f8;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Command option",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "command-option",
      "description": "Tool name and example query form one generous active option inside the scrolling slash menu.",
      "html": "<div role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"Search tools\"><button class=\"ds-command-option\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"true\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 7h8M8 11h2m4 0h2m-8 4h2m4 0h2\"/></svg><span><strong>Calculator</strong><span>24 * 18 + 6</span></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-command-option{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;padding:10px 15px;min-height:64px;width:100%;text-align:left;border:0;background:white;border-radius:10px;color:#53647b;cursor:pointer}.ds-command-option>span{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;min-width:0}.ds-command-option strong{font-size:13px;color:#202124;font-weight:500}.ds-command-option>span>span{font-size:12px;color:#62666c;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-command-option>svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-command-option[aria-selected=true]{background:#f0f5fe;color:#1967d2}.ds-command-option:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8ab4f8;outline-offset:-3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Clock utility",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "utility-button",
      "description": "A tabular clock reading and explicit start/reset controls within the tinted tool, shown in its ready state.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-clock-tool\"><output class=\"ds-clock\" aria-label=\"Time remaining\">05:00</output><div class=\"ds-clock-actions\"><button class=\"ds-clock-start\" type=\"button\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m8 4 12 8-12 8z\"/></svg>Start timer</button><button type=\"button\">Reset</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-clock-tool{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#202124)}.ds-clock{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(37px,8vw,64px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:24px 0}.ds-clock-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-clock-actions button{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid #dce1e8;border-radius:9px;background:white;color:#39404b;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.ds-clock-actions .ds-clock-start{background:#1967d2;color:white;border-color:#1967d2}.ds-clock-actions button:hover{background:#edf2fa}.ds-clock-actions .ds-clock-start:hover{background:#1559bc}.ds-clock-actions button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1a73e8;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dictionary reference and source",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "A serif reference entry with a native expandable provenance disclosure; no extra raised card wrapper.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-reference\"><h2>serendipity</h2><p>The fortunate discovery of something valuable when you were looking for something else.</p><details class=\"ds-source\"><summary>Source &amp; details</summary><div><p>Curated reference entry based on Merriam-Webster. Definition paraphrased for this demo; two entries are available locally.</p><a href=\"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/serendipity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Merriam-Webster</a></div></details></div>",
      "css": ".ds-reference{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;color:#593f31}.ds-reference h2{font:400 37px/1.35 Georgia,serif;color:#66371f;margin:0 0 18px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-reference>p{font:21px/1.55 Georgia,serif;max-width:50ch;margin:0}.ds-source{margin-top:16px;font-size:11px;color:#855d48}.ds-source summary{min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;width:fit-content}.ds-source summary:hover{color:#a14621}.ds-source summary:focus-visible,.ds-source a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1967d2;outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}.ds-source>div{border-top:1px solid #e5d6ce;padding-top:10px;max-width:68ch}.ds-source p{margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.7}.ds-source a{display:inline-flex;min-height:28px;align-items:center;color:inherit;text-underline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Orbit model control",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "An adjustable model parameter with a visible value, full-height range target and scientific rather than decorative units.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-model-range\"><span>Central mass <output>1.00 \u00d7 Earth</output></span><input aria-label=\"Central mass in Earth masses\" type=\"range\" min=\".25\" max=\"3\" step=\".05\" value=\"1\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-model-range{font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;margin-bottom:13px;font-size:11px;color:#35586e}.ds-model-range>span{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}.ds-model-range output{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#244b65;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}.ds-model-range input{appearance:auto;display:block;padding:0;margin:2px 0 0;width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:44px;border:0;background:transparent;accent-color:#256087;cursor:pointer}.ds-model-range input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8ab4f8;outline-offset:3px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A search bar that takes the shape of your curiosity.",
    "overview": "The user-pinned Google-style world uses a white canvas, a familiar multicolour wordmark, charcoal text and restrained blue actions. The central wordmark is the only top identity; no header brand or view switch. Privacy, affiliation and implementation details live in Notes; the footer contains Notes and a quiet TypeSafe Jev attribution.\n\nThe query is the visual anchor. Its lower shell becomes one useful interface at a time. A slash control and searchable command menu make all 22 modes discoverable without a permanent example grid. Functional tools, curated knowledge and playful experiments share the same shell, with their own clear controls and source details.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "White space around one anchored search surface.",
      "Discovery through the slash menu; detail through progressive disclosure.",
      "Visible routing provenance and recognizably different, functional tool interiors."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Local Colour Rule",
        "body": "Change the tool tint, icon and related controls with the active intent; keep the page white.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Anchored Query Rule",
        "body": "Tool changes affect the lower shell. The textarea grows only with its content, up to 112px; inference must not reposition its caret.",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do retain the white canvas, anchored query and independent Fluid Search identity.",
      "Do keep slash discovery usable with pointer, keyboard and touch.",
      "Do preserve routing provenance and make data sources and limitations accessible.",
      "Do use 44px primary control targets, readable muted text and visible keyboard focus.",
      "Do require an explicit action for audio and provide pause, stop, replay or reset where relevant."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't restore the superseded dark composer or permanent example-card grid.",
      "Don't present selected tools, local syntax or reference content as Jev-generated results.",
      "Don't invent retrieved data, hide failure states or turn fixture values into facts.",
      "Don't move the active input or require animation to understand state."
    ]
  }
}
